Description: The denguedasets package provide a curated collection of open-access dengue fever surveillance and climate datasets for epidemiological research and machine learning. Includes surveillance records, climatic co-variates, and mortality indicators from Bangladesh, the Philippines, Taiwan, Sri Lanka, Brazil, Colombia, Pakistan, India, Peru, Indonesia, and Sierra Leone, spanning case counts, deaths, case-fatality rates, and associated meteorological variables (temperature, humidity, precipitation) suitable for spatiotemporal analysis, outbreak prediction, machine learning, and time-series modeling from Kaggle.
